{
  "$comment": [
    "Maps each tenant setting to the posture recommended in docs/tenant-settings-guidance.md.",
    "Consumed by get-tenant-settings.ps1 -Baseline to generate deploy/tenant-settings.baseline.bicepparam.",
    "",
    "Postures:",
    "  off        - assert enabled: false. Covers both 'Off' and 'Off unless needed' in the guidance,",
    "               since the baseline posture for both is off and enabling is a deliberate act.",
    "  on         - assert enabled: true.",
    "  on-scoped  - assert enabled: true with a placeholder enabledSecurityGroups. Fill in the group",
    "               before deploying, or the setting is asserted on with no scope at all.",
    "  decide     - no security-driven answer ('Org choice' in the guidance), or conditional on",
    "               something this file can't know. Emitted commented out so deploying asserts nothing.",
    "  excluded   - deliberately left out of the baseline entirely. Networking only, see below.",
    "",
    "The five Advanced networking settings are excluded rather than set. Private Link is the most",
    "disruptive change in Fabric and needs its own sequenced exercise, not a line in a bulk baseline.",
    "See the 'What stops working under Private Link' section of the guidance."
  ],

